type: software
title: "OEJN departure mapping: ground atlas, departure explorer and published-procedure datasets"
abstract: >-
  Maps and reference datasets for departures at King Abdulaziz International
  Airport (OEJN), Jeddah: a QGIS ground atlas, browser maps including a 3D
  departure explorer, and the 16 published departure procedures from runways
  34C and 34L, with source provenance for every value.
